Directory dependencies whose paths hold #, % and ? (file:libs/a#1, file:libs/b%41, file:libs/c?x), beside the directories a URL reading names (libs/a, libs/bA, libs/c): npm-package-arg 8.1.0 to 8.1.4 (npm 7.0.0 to 7.17.0) read the path as written, 8.1.5 to 12.0.1 as a URL (fragment, escape, query), 12.0.2 and later escape it first; a root dependency is added.
